localfont findfont
/xsz f f length 4 sub 4 getinterval cvi def
/ysz f f length 8 sub 4 getinterval cvi def
[ xsz 0 0 ysz neg 0 0 ] makefont dup f cvn exch def
setfont
}
ifelse
} bind def
